"高斋修竹林，积雪竹间深。\n岁暮不改色，幽人同此心。\n种梅分地隙，笼鹤就墙阴。\n想见椒江上，扁舟许客寻。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16414,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雪后 其一","author":"张翥","text":"雪后北风急，起行冰满须。\n冻泥忧蹇马，活火爱团蒲。\n数口狼依狈，群情虎畏貙。\n每逢来使问，亲故有书无。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16415,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雪后 其二","author":"张翥","text":"路滑堆残雪，山晴散宿霾。\n民生已涂炭，兵气尚江淮。\n抚世忧徒切，谋身计自垂。\n临觞且复醉，吾命有安排。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16416,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"癸巳元日即事","author":"张翥","text":"禁苑朝珂集，宫楼昼刻传。\n云开黄道日，春丽紫薇天。\n进虎蛮如画，仪鸾仗类仙。\n晨观净氛气，即是偃兵年。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16417,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"大驾时巡千官导送至大口","author":"张翥","text":"万乘巡行远，三灵佑护多。\n旌旄随大纛，鼓铎杂鸣驼。\n丽日浮黄伞，微风送玉珂。\n臣心如草色，不断到滦河。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16418,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"松巢为潜川谢尧章作","author":"张翥","text":"林栖有隐君，结构出尘氛。\n就树遮青雨，牵萝补白云。\n双鸠从此拙，独鹤与平分。\n华屋非无数，山中了不闻。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16419,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}